[
    {
        "content": "<p>I just vibe coded a map of bike lanes in Boston (and Cambridge and Brookline): <a href=\"https://bostonopen.dev/bikelanes/\">https://bostonopen.dev/bikelanes/</a></p>\n<p>Code at <a href=\"https://github.com/bostonopen/bikelanes\">https://github.com/bostonopen/bikelanes</a></p>\n<p>Feedback is welcome, of course!</p>",
        "id": 630001975,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1791420592
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-07 at 8.47.09 PM.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"3164x2062\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/56571/vDlxl_batqe1XdYVkr_AXD9P/Screenshot-2026-10-07-at-8.47.09PM.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/56571/vDlxl_batqe1XdYVkr_AXD9P/Screenshot-2026-10-07-at-8.47.09PM.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
        "id": 630002000,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1791420604
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>So far it covers Boston, Brookline, Cambridge, Somerville, and Watertown.</p>",
        "id": 630005175,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1791422276
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I switched it to directional arrows:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-10 at 7.34.26 PM.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"924x1134\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/56571/-s6nrzD5dIptexgmCR5PwitG/Screenshot-2026-10-10-at-7.34.26PM.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/56571/-s6nrzD5dIptexgmCR5PwitG/Screenshot-2026-10-10-at-7.34.26PM.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
        "id": 630686299,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1791675307
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I added a blue dot for one's location and the ability to rotate and tilt.</p>\n<p>I'm very impressed with MapLibre! <a href=\"https://maplibre.org\">https://maplibre.org</a></p>",
        "id": 630755640,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1791724452
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I keep adding towns:</p>\n<p><code>[\"name\"~\"^(Arlington|Bedford|Boston|Brookline|Cambridge|Lexington|Milton|Newton|Somerville|Watertown)$\"]</code></p>",
        "id": 631140097,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1791852163
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I used it to bike to the Blue Hills today. Worked like a charm.</p>",
        "id": 631140166,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1791852187
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Pretty cool for like planning a trip.</p>",
        "id": 631488612,
        "sender_full_name": "Dan",
        "timestamp": 1791940133
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Does it do anything that opencyclemap doesn't do or was it just an exercise?</p>",
        "id": 631488654,
        "sender_full_name": "Dan",
        "timestamp": 1791940155
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I'd argue that mine is much more clear about which side of the road the bike lane is on:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-14 at 8.45.30 AM.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"3164x2062\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/56571/h44Nb7D97cU5GR3d8PtGpZ-N/Screenshot-2026-10-14-at-8.45.30AM.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/56571/h44Nb7D97cU5GR3d8PtGpZ-N/Screenshot-2026-10-14-at-8.45.30AM.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
        "id": 631637097,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1791981980
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Another comparison (and the <a href=\"https://github.com/cyclosm/cyclosm-cartocss-style/issues/700\">issue</a> I opened):</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-14 at 8.50.50 AM.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"3164x2062\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/56571/RhqXguABVdedKyVKid4FCnHk/Screenshot-2026-10-14-at-8.50.50AM.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/56571/RhqXguABVdedKyVKid4FCnHk/Screenshot-2026-10-14-at-8.50.50AM.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
        "id": 631639369,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1791982301
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I just live in a world where it really matters which side of the street the bike lane is on.</p>",
        "id": 631639704,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1791982361
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>No kidding! It's more clear that there's a bike lane at all. OCM perhaps could use some styling improvements even if they don't want to take the time to move to vector.</p>",
        "id": 631781884,
        "sender_full_name": "Dan",
        "timestamp": 1792014345
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Though OCM is for biking in general not just lanes. So you can afford to make a bigger contrast. Then again if they switch to vector they can show and hide other items of interest via UI buttons.</p>",
        "id": 631782114,
        "sender_full_name": "Dan",
        "timestamp": 1792014434
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I'm glad you like it! I'm so excited about it. <span aria-label=\"smile\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f604\" role=\"img\" title=\"smile\">:smile:</span></p>",
        "id": 631804275,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1792022587
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>And yeah, the whole idea is to use it for planning. That's how I'm using it.</p>",
        "id": 631809403,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1792024679
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Google Maps is useless for showing which side of the street the bike lane is on. A comparison with <a href=\"https://bostonopen.dev/bikelanes/\">https://bostonopen.dev/bikelanes/</a> below:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-16 at 9.21.33 PM.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"3164x2062\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/56571/xXjA-GVAMtx633sjq5uDS8Rr/Screenshot-2026-10-16-at-9.21.33PM.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/56571/xXjA-GVAMtx633sjq5uDS8Rr/Screenshot-2026-10-16-at-9.21.33PM.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
        "id": 632419995,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin",
        "timestamp": 1792200154
    }
]